om/media/photo-o/10/6d/70/a3/karan-k.jpg", "contribution_count": 6, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2017-08-26", "published_at_date": "2017-08-26"}, {"review_id": 517564867, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r517564867-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Pious", "text": "Pashupati Nath Temple was very pious place, you feel positive energy when you be there, being a hindu at least once you have to visit in your life time...", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2017-08-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "1AEA0E7E3C130851433C4348DF33F397", "name": "jimsrao7", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/jimsrao7", "username": "jimsrao7", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/15/4d/cd/56/caption.jpg", "contribution_count": 98, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297608, "location_name": "Ahmedabad", "location_name_detailed": "Ahmedabad, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2017-08-26", "published_at_date": "2017-08-26"}, {"review_id": 517440829, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r517440829-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Spiritual Essence", "text": "Its a highly spiritual place but be prepared for lot of litter n filth everywhere. The dead bodies are cremated here. You can actually see all of it happening. If you are not a Hindu, you cannot enter the main temple but you can still see it from next door temple. Becareful while taking pix of any Saadhu here. They ll ask money from you after you take their picture. According to our licensed tour guide, most of them are fake saadhu, but not all of them. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2017-08-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "A72A3405FF2C13D7AFD4032F413A294E", "name": "Tyme-Traveller-2020", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Tyme-Traveller-2020", "username": "Tyme-Traveller-2020", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/ea/74/default-avatar-2020-68.jpg", "contribution_count": 112, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 186338, "location_name": "London", "location_name_detailed": "London, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/10/6c/16/11/photo0jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/10/6c/16/12/photo1jpg.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2017-08-25", "published_at_date": "2017-08-26"}, {"review_id": 516976732, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r516976732-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Apparently powerful but, be prepared for filth", "text": "A cremation ghat is abutting on the temple. Entire temple is utterly filthy with rotten flowers and stench everywhere. But, this temple is supposed to be very powerful. So, I would say you avoid all the rituals and drama and just sit in a quiet place for some time and leave.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 3, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2017-07-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "BCE6761B1F993C1470204A9BB42EAB63", "name": "Krishnaprasad K", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Prasad69", "username": "Prasad69", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/de/5a/default-ava